  "content": "<p>Block out a small playable space with simple primitives to test scale, layout and sightlines before any detailed modeling.</p>\n<h2>Learning Objectives</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Establish player scale and metrics for a space</li>\n<li>Lay out a space for navigation and focal points</li>\n<li>Iterate on a greybox before committing to detail</li>\n</ol>\n"
